OL,3,GNEWSAFrustration as council house
OL,4,Ademand 'outweighs supply'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA single mum on the highest priority
OL,7,Fband for council housing says the wait
OL,8,Ffor a larger home is a "daily
OL,9,Ffrustration".
OL,11,FDawn lives in a three-bedroom council
OL,12,Fhouse in Fawley, Hampshire, along with
OL,13,Fher three sons.
OL,15,FTwo of her sons have disabilities which
OL,16,Fmean they require additional support
OL,17,Fand supervision.
