OL,3,GNEWSAFrustration as council house
OL,4,Ademand 'outweighs supply'
OL,5,
OL,6,FDawn thinks those living in council
OL,7,Fhouses that are bigger than their
OL,8,Fcurrent needs should be downsized, but
OL,9,FNew Forest District Council said it
OL,10,F"cannot require people to leave their
OL,11,Fhome" for that reason.
